steps.prompt_template:
Tickers to cover: {state.tickers}
Sources to read: {state.sources}

Scrape each source page, follow the links to the stories that concern these tickers (extract_links, then scrape_url), and collect for EACH ticker the 3–5 most relevant developments from the last few days. For each: date, headline, one line on why it matters, source URL. Finish with a short 'Market-wide' section of themes that affect all of them.

